// Futura Round is NOT bundled or self-hosted, and is not currently served to users.
//
// DECISION (FED lead, 2026-08-14): no Futura binaries in this repo until a web-font
// licence is produced. Basis and evidence, so this isn't re-litigated:
//   - The F2R design workspace excludes the Futura OTF/WOFF2 folders from git,
//     citing "Monotype Desktop EULA prohibits server installation / redistribution"
//     (f2r/.gitignore). No font binary exists anywhere on that branch.
